      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Fluides !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0046006C007500690064006500730020002100100002011401E60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Elles frappent l’adversaire plus de fois\nqu’il n’a le temps de dire « aïe » !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si tous les coups font mouche,\nles dégâts le couchent !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006900200074006F007500730020006C0065007300200063006F00750070007300200066006F006E00740020006D006F0075006300680065002C000A006C006500730020006400E9006700E2007400730020006C006500200063006F0075006300680065006E00740020002100100002011401E60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Elles ont en plus l’avantage d’être difficiles à\nbloquer avec des capacités comme Abri !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et puis, si on les combine à des objets qui\nboostent le taux de critiques...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n*soupir* Quel potentiel stratégique infini ! ♪<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 131
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais attends, je n’ai pas fini !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00610069007300200061007400740065006E00640073002C0020006A00650020006E2019006100690020007000610073002000660069006E00690020002100100002011401E60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Euh...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500750068002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est un peu long, là, non ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043201900650073007400200075006E00200070006500750020006C006F006E0067002C0020006C00E0002C0020006E006F006E0020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oups... J’enchaîne les mots comme j’enchaîne\nles attaques, que veux-tu !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nMais un combat vaut mille mots. Tu vas découvrir\nl’excellence des capacités à coups multiples !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 176
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Reviens me voir lorsque tu seras prêt<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe\nà combattre.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1800,
